### Create source account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Alice",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "openingBalance": 1000.00
}

### Create destination account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Bob",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "openingBalance": 100.00
}

### Create payment (replace UUIDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "SOURCE_UUID",
  "destinationAccountId": "DESTINATION_UUID",
  "amount": 125.00,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Poll payment until SETTLED or FAILED (replace UUID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/PAYMENT_UUID

### View source ledger after settlement (replace UUID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/SOURCE_UUID/transactions
